 When you start an experiment, `multi_rewrite` reads `base_names` and updates the related configs automatically (object models, initial poses, goal poses, and C3+ tuning for the object count).
 
+An optional `sampling_meshes` list in
+`parameters/sampling_c3_controller_params.yaml` can override only the meshes
+used for global surface sampling.  It must have the same order and length as
+`base_names`.  The complete `object_models` are still used for dynamics and
+contact geometry.  This hook supports safe-only semantic sampling without
+removing protected/neutral geometry from the physical model.  Omitting the key
+preserves the original behavior.
+
